## Keep Docker context minimal: ship only the source tree and the runtime jars
## that the build stage in the Dockerfile actually consumes.

# Everything by default; allow-list specific paths below.
*
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore

# Source we need to compile inside the image.
!kems.prover
kems.prover/bin
kems.prover/output
kems.prover/tests
kems.prover/**/*.log

# Bundled third-party / generated jars referenced by the IntelliJ modules.
!kems.export
kems.export/*
!kems.export/lib
kems.export/lib/*
!kems.export/lib/ext
!kems.export/lib/generated

# Anything else in the repo (paper, PDFs, old code, etc.) is excluded
# implicitly because the wildcard above kept it out unless re-added here.
